    "Accommodating and willing. Just make sure you genuinely mean it — pets are a long commitment." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inskiklik en bereid. Maak net seker jy bedoel dit regtig – troeteldiere is ’n lang verbintenis."
