    "Future-focused by instinct. You feel safer with a bigger cushion. That's valuable — especially if your partner leans toward spending." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instinktief toekomsgerig. Jy voel veiliger met ’n groter kussing. Dis waardevol – veral as jou maat meer na spandeer neig."
