        "xh" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intuthuzelo yomzimba lulwimi lwakho lokuqala. Ngamanye amaxesha ukwanga kuthetha yonke into amazwi angakwaziyo ukuyithetha — ingakumbi kumzuzu wokuqala."
