        "mi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "E aro ana ki te wā nei. Kāore koe i hangaia mō te whakamahere wā roa — he taiohi rānei koe, ā, he mea ariā noa tēnei ki a koe."
