        "so" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tani waxay saamaysaa sida aad tamar ugu soo ceshato, ula dhaqanto dadka iyo inta meel bannaan ah ee aad xiriirka uga baahan tahay."
