        },
        "rw" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ibi bigira ingaruka kuri byose — amarangamutima yawe, kwihangana kwawe, ubushobozi bwawe bwo kwiyegereza abandi. Ni byiza kubishyira imbere."
